        "note":  "DRAFT dialogue; expression choice editorial, review in context",
        "source_script":  "CHAPTER_I_SCRIPT.md"
    },
    {
        "scene_id":  "C1-08",
        "line_id":  "C1-08-L001",
        "speaker_id":  "C02",
        "spoken_text":  "Penjaga bilang kau muncul dari hutan tanpa ingatan.",
